// # .github/workflows/ — GitHub Pages Deploy
//
// Logline: The CI pipeline that publishes the website to GitHub
//          Pages on every push to main.
//
// Beats:
//   1. deploy.yml — single job: checkout, configure-pages,
//      upload-pages-artifact (path: .), deploy-pages. No build
//      step. The website is published as-is.
//
// This directory is for GitHub-managed CI configuration only. No
// hand-maintained application code belongs here.
